 603:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****         naive way (by calling lv_color_make with components):
 604:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****                     r = ((c & 0xFF0000) >> 19)
 605:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/hal/../draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****                     g = ((c & 0xFF00) >> 10)
